								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >In the game, you will play the role of a housewife and experience all the household duties firsthand. Your husband will also check on you periodically.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.poster.avif?t=1792078188" width=780 height=380 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.webm?t=1792078188" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/57e703b7036b06e579c226967eed4237.mp4?t=1792078188" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You will have to cook, wash the dishes, do the laundry, iron and dry underwear and socks, mop the floor.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/5aac38ced0cb1288262b8461caf9fb5c.poster.avif?t=1792078188" width=780 height=380 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/5aac38ced0cb1288262b8461caf9fb5c.webm?t=1792078188" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072240/extras/5aac38ced0cb1288262b8461caf9fb5c.mp4?t=1792078188" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >In addition, you need to monitor your morale and your husband's mood. Take a bath to relax after cleaning, flatter your husband to cheer him up.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					The music and some of the images were created using artificial intelligence. Localization into some languages was performed using artificial intelligence.				</i>
			</p>
